  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/B35024">Definition <span data-tag="B35024">5.2.9.2</span>.</a>strongly generatesgenerates!strongly Let $f: \calC \rightarrow \calD $ be a functor between $\infty $-categories. We will say that $f$ is <em>strongly generates</em> the $\infty $-category $\calD $ if the identity transformation $\id : f \rightarrow f$ exhibits the identity functor $\id _{\calD }$ as a left Kan extension of $f$ along $f$. </p>
